{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-12_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-12","title":"惡言，報應不爽","storyCode":"M8-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"23db928157b5703537ae1e103282dcba96f7191e2ff32d054747ddaf4bcd0aa4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"W趕上盾衛與阿米婭眾人，她表明立場，勉強得到阿米婭的信任。同時，博士與凱爾希逐步接近石棺核心，在途中遭遇薩卡茲牧群。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"這些屍體......已經開始腐敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"W的人。魔族佬雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，我們沒對他們動手。這是私刑，明擺著的暗地處決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"從很早以前就開始了嗎，內部清洗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚。可能就是這幾天的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，很明顯的，塔露拉籌謀很久了。可恨，為什麼就連我們也沒能早點認出她的真面目？她這麼會演戲嗎，這個魔頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，塔露拉指揮著這些薩卡茲雇傭兵對付我們，不管他們是不是心甘情願的。那還有殺死雇傭兵的必要嗎？這是不是殺一儆百？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，不可能......沒人能威脅一個薩卡茲，更別說一群薩卡茲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，沒錯，“誰要是威脅魔族佬，魔族佬就會殺了誰”，你要問我們遊擊隊這幾個也是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，他們要是因為追隨W所以被殺了，那W究竟站在哪一邊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你猜猜看我站哪邊？答對有獎哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！舉起手來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，喔，別動手。哇。好大的劍。羅德島的新打手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......W......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"就是你......就是你殺了Scout！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"就是她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那Scout先生的仇就讓我來報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。小白貓，殺我可以，但我做的事我會認，不是我做的事我可不會認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我得提醒那邊那個穿成整合運動樣子的羅德島小哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我認得出你也記得你，是我放跑了你，你想一想，我完全不用把你讓給老爺子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout是為你們羅德島而死的。我是被迫取走了他的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好，他完全可以一個人逃掉。他為了保住你和你們其他人的命，和我演了一齣戲給整合運動看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我願意殺他？我願意殺一個薩卡茲，一個薩卡茲裡現在都沒剩下幾個的匿形大師，真正的神射手，下一個卡茲戴爾英雄胚子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"說謊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我發脾氣？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙，也敢對我發脾氣？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我才要對你發脾氣！如果你本事大點，如果你們當場宰了那條龍女，怎麼還會死那麼多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼還要我去殺Scout，去殺我看得起的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是以為我是戰爭販子？我告訴你，我是。是，沒錯，但和你們不一樣，人的價值在我這裡是有分級的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout......你們給我聽著！就算在巴別塔，Scout也是我覺得最有價值的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"他比我貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......我再問一遍，你們究竟有什麼價值讓他為你們死掉？啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，咳，呸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"舉起手。放下武器。我不相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒被塔露拉燒個稀碎，沒被凱爾希的怪物丟在牆上撞死已經很幸運了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在，能不能別再煩我些有的沒的......？不是手上的傢伙大說話就更有道理的，否則炸死那麼多人的我豈不是正確到爆開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"順便，凱爾希也說了，現在我和你們是站一邊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我站你們這邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要聽錄音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼那麼急躁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你這小鬼也能讀心嗎還是怎麼的？那你還不信我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然急。再不幹掉塔露拉，我的人就要都給她弄死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲雇傭兵有個缺點，在殺人之外的時候他們是不會審時度勢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟他們說什麼，他們就會去做什麼，原因無他，他們根本不在乎自己，不重視生命，自己的別人的，都無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我再不去把他們重新搞回來，他們可就都要死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你能說服他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"在殺了塔露拉之後吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，浪費更多時間了，能給我讓個路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"小哥，我就一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓他白死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的有這個權力嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你有的。你的命是我的老同事們堆出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，夠了！迷迭香，讓她走吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她說的是真的？她保護了阿米婭她們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"就相信我，也相信她這麼一回。就這麼一回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我可以走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"別再讓我看見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"——別再讓我看見你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那謝謝。放心吧，如果這回沒殺掉這個龍女，我們肯定就沒機會再見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"他們已經行了，現在，遊擊隊兄弟們，你們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"大尉說過你不值得依賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得那個老頭說得一點都沒錯。我說的真真假假的東西太多，要從中發掘點有意義的東西還挺難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我是沒辦法讓你們正眼看我的，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"但只有把塔露拉炸成灰這件事，我比誰都想幹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"順便，我可要說一句，你們，別老盯著別人的後背看。你根本不懂，你們不懂魔族身上發生了些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不知道我這幾個死了的雇傭兵是為什麼而死的。別用那種眼神看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。你們是不是就是用這種眼神看那個龍女的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的傷，你已經和塔露拉交過手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那你眼神可真好，我站在你面前才十多分鐘你就發現了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我和她幹了一架。而且我還輸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你傷得不輕，又打不贏，你想怎樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我還活著，已經夠了。如果那個羅德島的兔子做不到，那我就要再炸塔露拉一回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_28"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是她的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要去送死，我們不攔你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是可以繞道走的，朋友。我完全能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想到你們會和羅德島在一起，但我，我是來見你們一面的，我是特意來的。為了救你們一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到我那些可憐兄弟的屍體了沒？你們都該看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位兄弟，在這座城市裡可不止剩下平民和整合運動啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯的士兵穿著我們的衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經遇到過他們了。我們也已經做好了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"做好了準備？你是不是想說你做好了準備？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"長舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是說實話，我很少說實話。可別是做好了送死的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉既然敢搞這一套，說明她根本不在乎整合運動。她想整合運動死在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再見，各位。只要運氣好，我們就都能活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們如果不信我，就試著去相信自己的運氣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祝各位好運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_graduate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經十分接近石棺的核心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在擔心什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我擔心自己會保護不好你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不，Dr.{@nickname}，總有一天我會保護不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，太多超出我們預想的力量在這大地上相互博弈，他們天災般的暴力行徑，既會帶來無法預知的問題，也會帶來出乎預料的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使知道一切，也未必能改變一切，這是眾多悲劇的根源，也是許多旅程的開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"其次，Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否的確是一個值得我去保護的人？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還猜謎？！","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是利用資訊不對等對你施加壓力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，逼急了就算是卡特斯也會咬人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但把答案直接告訴你，只是讓你更加懷疑事實。你應當自己爭取真相，或者等待它直接向你打開。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會回答我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚......因為你以前就是這樣一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你不是那個人。Dr.{@nickname}，答應我，你和過去的不是同一個人。"}]},{"label":"我難道不值得你這麼做嗎，凱爾希醫生？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我有對你下過咒嗎，Dr.{@nickname}？這個咒語解開了，然後反撲在我身上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"值得與否不是我來判斷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是不值得，我也會這麼做，理由的話，一會兒我也許有機會說給你聽。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——牧群！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"你們到哪去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"回家嗎？回回回回家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可以斷定，整個核心區的薩卡茲雇傭兵都已經遭到了轉化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"各位幹員，打開自淨開關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在拯救他人的生命之前，先保護好自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......你真的要承載起這樣不幸的種族的命運嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]}]}
